Heals your Tamed Pet for $<total> health over $d.

This ability is usable while shapeshifted.

@ext:Tamed Pet includes Summoned Demon, Enslave Demon, Dominate Undead, Tame Dragonkin, Tether Elemental, Summoned Ghoul, and Tame Beast.:ext@

